00:56:06,250 --> 00:56:07,310
So here's the MLP.

1286
00:56:07,310 --> 00:56:10,850
Here's the vanilla transformer with self-attention.

1287
00:56:10,850 --> 00:56:13,730
And this is roughly the standard architecture

1288
00:56:13,730 --> 00:56:15,570
we use in computer vision.

1289
00:56:15,570 --> 00:56:17,850
The architecture we use in language processing

1290
00:56:17,850 --> 00:56:21,210
has one small difference, which I'll come to in a minute.

